I went near the counter of the café.
There was a woman there.
Her name is Sunita.
She has been working here for a long time.
She saw me and smiled.
Sunita said - "Good morning!
Welcome here."
I also smiled.
I said - "Good morning, madam.
My name is Maya."
Sunita says - "Maya, today is your first day here."
She is very cheerful.
She says - "Today you are learning to work here."
Sunita gave me an apron.
She says - "Please wear this."
I put on the apron.
I say - "I am ready."
She says - "Excellent, we begin now."
